# Editor, OS and backup artifacts. These matter more than usual here:
# everything under public/ is served verbatim by express.static, so a stray
# *.bak or *.backup-<date> next to a page is a publicly retrievable copy of
# application source. See test/public-artifact-hygiene.test.js.
*.bak
*.backup
*.backup-*
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
*.swp
*.swo
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Emulator and tooling debug output.
firebase-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
